-He's dead.

2013
01:11:52,342 --> 01:11:56,347
SERVO: Even in death, he amuses.

2014
01:11:56,380 --> 01:12:05,388
Carla.

2015
01:12:05,422 --> 01:12:09,225
MIKE: Our bartender died.

2016
01:12:09,258 --> 01:12:11,328
CROW: Thank God.
For a minute I thought this war

2017
01:12:11,362 --> 01:12:12,562
