2018
01:12:12,595 --> 01:12:16,600
[ Crying ]

2019
01:12:16,633 --> 01:12:18,402
MIKE: So, this is the elevator?

2020
01:12:18,435 --> 01:12:21,805
[ Screams ]

2021
01:12:21,838 --> 01:12:24,442
First estimates indicate
that more than 30,000 dead

2022
01:12:24,475 --> 01:12:27,210
with the victims of the
A-bombing of New York City,

2023
01:12:27,243 --> 01:12:29,847
when an enemy plane
pierced our defenses

2024
01:12:29,880 --> 01:12:32,348
