2036
01:12:53,670 --> 01:12:56,140
Here are some air pictures
of the damage.

2037
01:12:56,173 --> 01:12:58,875
About a third of the city
has been quarantined.

2038
01:12:58,908 --> 01:13:00,610
-Radiation.
-SERVO: Lot of owies and stuff.

2039
01:13:00,643 --> 01:13:01,945
How did the radiation casualties

2040
01:13:01,978 --> 01:13:03,647
