2050
01:13:20,697 --> 01:13:22,632
Today, we made
the critical attack.

2051
01:13:22,665 --> 01:13:25,535
SERVO: It's a spebs... meeting.

2052
01:13:25,568 --> 01:13:26,937
Every man, speak English,

2053
01:13:26,970 --> 01:13:29,372
