To keep our all air strength
away from the West.

2071
01:14:01,338 --> 01:14:02,238
CROW: Oh.

2072
01:14:02,272 --> 01:14:03,307
Or it could be,

2073
01:14:03,340 --> 01:14:05,075
perhaps, that's what
he wants us to think.

2074
01:14:05,108 --> 01:14:07,110
-SERVO: Oh, he's a knob.
-Perhaps he'd like us to send

2075
01:14:07,143 --> 01:14:10,047
