2077
01:14:12,615 --> 01:14:13,783
Put the red alert on everywhere.

2078
01:14:13,817 --> 01:14:15,852
-CROW: I get to do it.
-MIKE: No, I'll do it.

2079
01:14:15,885 --> 01:14:17,553
-CROW: No, I'm doing it.
-MIKE: You fend their attacks.

2080
01:14:17,587 --> 01:14:24,895
SERVO: Size-14 navy pants,
