2097
01:15:10,240 --> 01:15:10,873
Uh-oh.

2098
01:15:10,907 --> 01:15:12,042
No, don't go out there.

2099
01:15:12,075 --> 01:15:14,310
No, I sense stock footage.

2100
01:15:14,343 --> 01:15:17,915
CROW: Oh, boy.

2101
01:15:17,948 --> 01:15:20,050
I'm flossing my hinder,
