That's the Joker.

2111
01:15:42,805 --> 01:15:44,808
One south, one east,
and one north.

2112
01:15:44,842 --> 01:15:46,042
You sent out interceptors?

2113
01:15:46,108 --> 01:15:48,312
-After all three.
-CROW: I'm rankishly handsome.

2114
01:15:48,312 --> 01:15:49,947
-You don't suppose...
-There have been no reports

2115
01:15:50,013 --> 01:15:51,715
