2145
01:16:58,815 --> 01:16:59,817
MIKE: Mm-hmm.
Mm-hmm.

2146
01:16:59,850 --> 01:17:00,650
SERVO: Pardon me one second.

2147
01:17:00,683 --> 01:17:01,818
CROW: Excuse me, Ivan.

2148
01:17:01,852 --> 01:17:04,253
