2164
01:17:46,563 --> 01:17:48,365
Whew.

2165
01:17:48,398 --> 01:17:50,533
CROW:
Obsessive-compulsive skydiver.

2166
01:17:50,567 --> 01:17:52,568
Oh, four of my chutes
didn't open.

2167
01:17:52,602 --> 01:17:54,103
Oh, I'm okay.

2168
01:17:54,137 --> 01:17:55,338
MIKE: The Piano Part 2,

2169
01:17:55,372 --> 01:18:02,745
-Where Pianos Dare.
-SERVO: Where pianos dare.

2170
01:18:02,778 --> 01:18:06,617
CROW: So, what part
of Washington D.C. is this?

2171
01:18:06,650 --> 01:18:09,152
