Double the companies guarding
the White House, the Capitol,

2183
01:18:26,570 --> 01:18:28,338
the senate building
and the House.

2184
01:18:28,372 --> 01:18:29,205
Yes, sir.

2185
01:18:29,238 --> 01:18:30,707
And have them
challenge everybody

2186
01:18:30,740 --> 01:18:33,277
