Who goes there?

2190
01:18:38,282 --> 01:18:40,250
Company B, 183rd Infantry.

2191
01:18:40,283 --> 01:18:42,885
183rd, that's an Illinois
outfit, ain't it?

2192
01:18:42,918 --> 01:18:44,187
Yes, yes.

2193
01:18:44,220 --> 01:18:46,457
-Chicago, Illinois.
-MIKE: Do you know Bob?

2194
01:18:46,490 --> 01:18:48,057
Did you ever go see
the Cubs play?

2195
01:18:48,092 --> 01:18:50,427
SERVO: Yeah, they won.
Oh, damn, no.

2196
01:18:50,460 --> 01:18:52,295
Cubs?

2197
01:18:52,328 --> 01:18:53,863
A cub is a young animal, a bear.

2198
01:18:53,897 --> 01:18:55,765
Sergeant of the guards!
Sergeant of the guards!

2199
01:18:55,798 --> 01:18:57,533
CROW: No, no, no.

2200
01:18:57,567 --> 01:18:59,735
Ooh.

2201
01:18:59,770 --> 01:19:00,937
