doubly vigilant now.

2211
01:19:21,692 --> 01:19:24,260
Let us set an example
of fighting Americanism...

2212
01:19:24,293 --> 01:19:26,630
CROW: We got to get him off,
we're losing the crowd.

2213
01:19:26,663 --> 01:19:29,698
-SERVO: Zoinks.
-ARTHUR: Let us continue to...

2214
01:19:29,732 --> 01:19:30,767
CROW: I call shut up.

2215
01:19:30,800 --> 01:19:33,068
Gentlemen, gentlemen,
the enemy is attempting

2216
01:19:33,102 --> 01:19:35,272
to seize the seat of government!

2217
01:19:35,305 --> 01:19:36,473
We are surrounded!

2218
01:19:36,507 --> 01:19:38,875
CROW: One more song,
and then we got to go.

2219
01:19:38,908 --> 01:19:41,645
Hide your prostitutes.

2220
01:19:41,678 --> 01:19:47,550
