2226
01:19:56,025 --> 01:19:57,960
He wasn't only wrong, he's dead.

2227
01:19:57,993 --> 01:20:00,497
MIKE: Guess he won't do
that again.

2228
01:20:00,530 --> 01:20:02,432
CROW: Sorry, Bob,
they're out of pineapple.

2229
01:20:02,465 --> 01:20:04,433
Enemy demands surrender
of my state

2230
01:20:04,467 --> 01:20:07,270
