our principal cities.

2231
01:20:07,303 --> 01:20:08,972
Can you protect me?

2232
01:20:09,005 --> 01:20:10,873
Signed, Gov. Clayton.

2233
01:20:10,907 --> 01:20:12,075
Can you?

2234
01:20:12,108 --> 01:20:14,010
SERVO: Tell him yes,
then postdate the letter.

2235
01:20:14,043 --> 01:20:15,012
How do we stand?

2236
01:20:15,045 --> 01:20:16,547
We're driving him
out of the city.

2237
01:20:16,580 --> 01:20:19,348
In another 24 hours,
the government will be safe.

2238
01:20:19,382 --> 01:20:22,352
Well, I'm glad to hear that.

2239
01:20:22,385 --> 01:20:24,420
Gentlemen, gentlemen,

2240
01:20:24,453 --> 01:20:26,055
