2488
01:28:53,763 --> 01:28:55,598
-Whoa.
-Oh, oh.

2489
01:28:55,665 --> 01:29:00,202
[ Screaming ]

2490
01:29:00,268 --> 01:29:02,172
Oh, well.

2491
01:29:02,172 --> 01:29:03,505
Hmm.

2492
01:29:03,572 --> 01:29:04,507
Letters?

2493
01:29:04,573 --> 01:29:06,408
Yeah, letters.
Good idea.

2494
01:29:06,442 --> 01:29:07,510
Why not?

2495
01:29:07,543 --> 01:29:09,545
Oh. Oh, my back hurts.

2496
01:29:09,578 --> 01:29:10,780
-Oh.
-Okay.

2497
01:29:10,813 --> 01:29:12,582
Well, we'll read this
first one here

2498
01:29:12,615 --> 01:29:14,583
from Alicia Evans and...

2499
01:29:14,617 --> 01:29:15,685
Hi, Alicia.

2500
01:29:15,718 --> 01:29:17,587
...put the text
on still store there.

2501
01:29:17,620 --> 01:29:18,922
-Yeah.
-She just has a nice letter.

2502
01:29:18,955 --> 01:29:20,457
She says hi
and how is everything

2503
01:29:20,490 --> 01:29:21,857
on the Satellite of Love.

2504
01:29:21,890 --> 01:29:23,158
-Good.
-Okay.

2505
01:29:23,192 --> 01:29:24,827
You're not missing much
on Earth.

2506
01:29:24,860 --> 01:29:26,162
-Oh, good.
-That makes me feel better.

2507
01:29:26,195 --> 01:29:28,163
I like when you guys
do skits or sing

2508
01:29:28,197 --> 01:29:30,365
or just talk to each other
every half hour.

2509
01:29:30,400 --> 01:29:32,535
Those are my favorite parts
of the show.

2510
01:29:32,568 --> 01:29:33,668
-Uh-huh.
-I like to draw pictures

2511
01:29:33,702 --> 01:29:35,237
of when you guys
do stuff like that.

2512
01:29:35,270 --> 01:29:37,005
-And then she includes some...
-Pictures.

2513
01:29:37,038 --> 01:29:38,107
-Ooh.
-Very colorful pictures...

2514
01:29:38,140 --> 01:29:39,742
-Those are nice.
-Oh, we'll skip that one.

2515
01:29:39,775 --> 01:29:41,210
That's nice.
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

2516
01:29:41,243 --> 01:29:44,013
Back up there.
Hey, what's that one?

2517
01:29:44,047 --> 01:29:46,515
This one says,
"Mike in his sailor suit."

2518
01:29:46,548 --> 01:29:47,617
CROW: Very nice.

2519
01:29:47,650 --> 01:29:48,550
I like the...

2520
01:29:48,583 --> 01:29:49,518
Rugged, huh?

2521
01:29:49,552 --> 01:29:50,620
Well, not really.

2522
01:29:50,653 --> 01:29:52,788
-All right.
-Definitely home on leave.

2523
01:29:52,822 --> 01:29:55,792
And then the last one
is a picture of us all

2524
01:29:55,825 --> 01:29:57,960
and put that up there
and it says,

2525
01:29:57,993 --> 01:29:59,628
"Gypsy sings well,"

2526
01:29:59,662 --> 01:30:01,063
which, you know, I don't know.

2527
01:30:01,097 --> 01:30:02,765
"Crow had a really cool hat on."

2528
01:30:02,798 --> 01:30:04,467
-I had a hat.
-He probably did.

2529
01:30:04,500 --> 01:30:07,170
Mike has a smile--
always has a smile...

2530
01:30:07,203 --> 01:30:09,005
-Aw, that's sweet.
-...that's forced onto my face.

2531
01:30:09,038 --> 01:30:11,640
And Tom is the smartest
of the robots.

2532
01:30:11,673 --> 01:30:13,342
-Well...
-Not anymore, huh?

2533
01:30:13,375 --> 01:30:14,443
No.

2534
01:30:14,477 --> 01:30:15,912
-Ooh!
-Claude?

2535
01:30:15,945 --> 01:30:17,213
-Funny.
-Vivian?

2536
01:30:17,247 --> 01:30:20,850
I'm almost convinced
that this isn't an illusion.

2537
01:30:20,883 --> 01:30:22,752
I'm gonna go lie down now.

2538
01:30:22,785 --> 01:30:24,287
Oh, oh.

2539
01:30:24,320 --> 01:30:25,855
Well, what do you think
you guys?

2540
01:30:25,888 --> 01:30:27,257
Is this all an illusion?

2541
01:30:27,290 --> 01:30:27,923
Hmm?

2542
01:30:27,957 --> 01:30:29,225
-You okay?
-SERVO: No.

2543
01:30:29,258 --> 01:30:31,927
-Oh.
-Is life an illusion.

2544
01:30:31,960 --> 01:30:33,395
In your dreams!

2545
01:30:33,428 --> 01:30:34,197
Geez.

2546
01:30:34,230 --> 01:30:35,798
Do you believe
these guys, Frank?

2547
01:30:35,832 --> 01:30:38,802
Talk about gullible.

2548
01:30:38,835 --> 01:30:41,437
Frank?

2549
01:30:41,470 --> 01:30:43,705
Who won the World Series?

2550
01:30:43,738 --> 01:30:45,708
I did.

2551
01:30:45,742 --> 01:30:48,043
Oh, okay.

2552
01:30:48,077 --> 01:30:50,913
Frank, why don't you check
out that guy, hmm?

2553
01:30:50,947 --> 01:30:54,950
Halt, who goes there?

2554
01:30:54,983 --> 01:30:57,320
Who won the World Series?

2555
01:30:57,353 --> 01:31:00,923
Well, until next time,
collective doofuses.

2556
01:31:00,957 --> 01:31:03,025
[ Gunshot ]

2557
01:31:03,058 --> 01:32:05,320
[ Music playing ]

2558
01:32:05,353 --> 01:32:06,855
Extra, paper,

2559
01:32:06,988 --> 01:32:09,358
America invaded. Read all about it!

